Output public/img/hello-world.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 56
Set Width 1280
Set Height 500
Set Padding 60
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set Theme "Dracula"

Hide
Type "PS1='$ ' node"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+L
Sleep 300ms
Show

Sleep 700ms
Type "console.log('hello world');"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
